--- !u!114 &950651337
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 950651334}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5f7201a12d95ffc409449d95f23cf332, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: UnityEngine.UI::UnityEngine.UI.Text
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_FontData:
    m_Font: {fileID: 10102, guid: 0000000000000000e000000000000000, type: 0}
    m_FontSize: 15
    m_FontStyle: 0
    m_BestFit: 0
    m_MinSize: 10
    m_MaxSize: 40
    m_Alignment: 0
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 1
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "<b>1. B\xE0n c\u1EDD chung 15x30:</b> Hai ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u01A1i thi
    \u0111\u1EA5u \u0111\u1ED3ng th\u1EDDi. P1 \u1EDF tr\xEAn r\u01A1i xu\u1ED1ng
    (-Y), P2 \u1EDF d\u01B0\u1EDBi r\u01A1i l\xEAn (+Y).\n\n<b>2. R\xE0o ch\u1EAFn
    trung t\xE2m:</b> Lu\xF4n c\xF3 2 h\xE0ng r\xE0o ch\u1EAFn c\u1ED1 \u0111\u1ECBnh
    \u1EDF gi\u1EEFa (h\xE0ng 14-15), kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 b\u1ECB ph\xE1 h\u1EE7y v\xE0
    ng\u0103n kh\xF4ng cho kh\u1ED1i l\u1EA5n sang s\xE2n \u0111\u1ED1i ph\u01B0\u01A1ng.\n\n<b>3.
    \u0110\u1EA9y kh\u1ED1i khi ph\xE1 h\xE0ng:</b> Khi m\u1ED9t b\xEAn ph\xE1 h\xE0ng,
    to\xE0n b\u1ED9 c\u1EA5u tr\xFAc kh\u1ED1i (k\xE8m r\xE0o ch\u1EAFn) s\u1EBD
    <b>b\u1ECB \u0111\u1EA9y d\u1ED3n v\u1EC1 ph\xEDa \u0111\u1ED1i th\u1EE7</b>
    \u0111\u1EC3 thu h\u1EB9p kh\xF4ng gian \u0111\u1EB7t kh\u1ED1i c\u1EE7a h\u1ECD!\n\n<b>4.
    M\u1EA5t tim & T\xE1i c\xE2n b\u1EB1ng:</b>\n   \u2022 Khi kh\u1ED1i g\u1EA1ch
    ch\u1EA1m m\xE9p bi\xEAn (P1 ch\u1EA1m h\xE0ng 29, P2 ch\u1EA1m h\xE0ng 0) \u2794
    <b>B\u1ECB tr\u1EEB 1 tim!</b>\n   \u2022 R\xE0o ch\u1EAFn tr\u1EDF v\u1EC1 gi\u1EEFa
    b\xE0n (h\xE0ng 14-15). B\xEAn m\u1EA5t m\xE1u b\u1ECB <b>x\xF3a s\u1EA1ch 100%
    g\u1EA1ch</b>.\n   \u2022 B\xEAn s\u1ED1ng s\xF3t x\xF3a 1/2 s\u1ED1 g\u1EA1ch
    \u1EDF ph\xEDa r\xE0o ch\u1EAFn, ph\u1EA7n c\xF2n l\u1EA1i \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
    d\u1ED3n s\xE1t v\xE0o r\xE0o ch\u1EAFn.\n\n<b>5. Chi\u1EBFn th\u1EAFng:</b>
    M\u1ED7i b\xEAn c\xF3 3 tim. B\xEAn n\xE0o h\u1EBFt tim tr\u01B0\u1EDBc s\u1EBD
    thua cu\u1ED9c!"
